                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">The United Nations</hi>: <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg1">Organization and arrangements for the conduct of
                                    United States relations with the United Nations</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>General United States policy toward the United Nations: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg30">I. The United States and the United
                                            Nations: reaffirmation of the policy of the United
                                            States to support and strengthen the United Nations and
                                            related agencies</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg35">II. Attitude of the United States toward
                                            the proposal by the Secretary-General of the United
                                            Nations for the establishment of a United Nations
                                            security guard</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg38">III. Establishment of the seat of the
                                            United Nations in the United States: matters related to
                                            implementation of the Headquarters Agreement of 1947;
                                            the United States position regarding the General
                                            Convention on Privileges and Immunities of the United
                                            Nations</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>The East–West conflict in the United Nations setting: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg72">I. The “Essentials of Peace”
