                                            Sino-Soviet Treaty of August 14, 1945</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>The United States at the United Nations: the United States
                                position regarding certain problems of United Nations organization
                                and procedure: <list>
                                    <item>
