                                            representation at the United Nations</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg291">III. United States policy regarding the
                                            question of admittance of new members into the United
                                            Nations</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg310">IV. Policy of the United States
                                            regarding the problem of voting procedures in the
                                            Security Council</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg331">V. Policy of the United States
                                            regarding the apportionment of expenses of the regular
                                            (administrative) budget of the United Nations among
                                            members of the Organization</ref>
                                    </item>
